{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107256","id":2575425714,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZgeCy","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107256","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107256.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107256.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107256","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107256/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107256/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107256/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0ce53ffc694935a69d6ff6579ac78ce6aa97a06a","number":107256,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Change `NavigationServer2D` avoidance callbacks from `Vector3` to `Vector2`","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Changes `NavigationServer2D` avoidance callbacks from `Vector3` to `Vector2`.\r\n\r\nThis was always an oddball close to a bug that no one wanted to change because it would be a (small) compatibility break.\r\n\r\nIt was the result of the `NavigationServer2D` using the NavigationServer3D behind the scene and no one adding a Vector2 callback to the api for 2d. It caused frequent annoyance for 2d users that tried to use it not expecting a Vector3 from a NavigationServer2D. E.g. raised in issues like https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106250.\r\n\r\nNow with the major change of a dedicated NavigationServer2D added in Godot 4.5 it is good time to change this as well.\r\n\r\n`NavigationAgent2D` users are not affected as this is just the internals changing.\r\n\r\nProjects that use the `NavigationServer2D.agent_set_avoidance_callback()` to create custom callbacks need to change their `Vector3` parameter to `Vector2` to not run into an error after this change.\r\n\r\nNavigation documentation has likely script examples with this that need to be updated as well.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1752040694,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzUyMDQwNjk0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:navigation","name":"topic:navigation","description":"","colo